            0.847,
            0.309
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Phrased more mathematically: In how many different ways can one write a number, say 8, as a sum of "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1’s",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
