            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2’s",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.309,
            0.406,
            0.328
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For example, we have:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.401,
            0.332,
            0.7,
            0.424
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_13_equation_7.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{array} { l } 8 = 2 + 2 + 2 + 2, \\\\ 8 = 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1, \\\\ 8 = 1 + 2 + 2 + 1 + 2, \\\\ 8 = 2 + 2 + 1 + 1 + 2, \\\\ \\text { e t c . } \\end{array}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.424,
            0.414,
            0.443
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you see other ways?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.442,
            0.846,
            0.48
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Here are all the ways of writing each of the numbers 1, 2, 3, and 4, as the sum of "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1’s",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2’s",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.24,
            0.484,
            0.758,
            0.757
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.24,
                0.484,
                0.758,
                0.757
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_13_table_10.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td>Different Ways</td><td>Number of Ways</td></tr><tr><td>n = 1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>n = 2</td><td>1 +2 1</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>n = 3</td><td>1 + 1 + 11 + 22 + 1</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>n = 4</td><td>1 + 1 + 1 + 11 + 1 + 21 + 2 + 12 + 1 + 12 + 2</td><td>5</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.768,
            0.848,
            0.843
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Try writing the number 5 as a sum of "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1s",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2s",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " in all possible ways in your notebook! How many ways did you find? (You should find 8 different ways!) Can you figure out the answer without listing down all the possibilities? Can you try it for n = 8?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.842,
            0.848,
            0.917
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Here is a systematic way to write down all rhythms of short and long syllables having 5 beats. Write a "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "‘1+’",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " in front of all rhythms having 4 beats, and then a "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "‘2+’",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " in front of all rhythms having 3 beats. This gives us all the rhythms having 5 beats:"
            }
          ]
        },
